+	// refuses runtimes without that fence. Authority is rechecked after signing
+	// and held through the durable append. An empty strict patch still checks
+	// the target, dataset sequence and current writer, but creates no history.
+	// Default false preserves the existing upstream write route.
+	RequireCurrentWriterFence bool
+
+	// IfObjectUnchangedSince is a separate, opt-in native objects-row CAS.
+	// It requires synced scope, Dataset == "objects", one strict (non-upsert)
+	// record whose explicit Id equals ObjectId, and no IfUnchangedSince.
+	// The existing native row's _applySeq must equal this value exactly under
+	// the object's tree lock. The signed append additionally holds current
+	// ACL authority through durable storage. A runtime without that fence
+	// refuses the write. Every mutation of this row, including A -> B -> A,
+	// invalidates the previous sequence. As with IfUnchangedSince, the caller
+	// must bind this process-local sequence to the current run/generation.
+	IfObjectUnchangedSince *uint64
